# Build context for postfix/docker/Dockerfile, built from the repository root.
# The image builds the engine and the milter from source and fetches the model
# at first start, so nothing built, downloaded or trained on the host belongs
# in the context: a host engine/build carries a CMakeCache from another path
# and fails the configure, and engine/model is 400 MB to 2 GB of weights the
# image must not contain.
**/build
**/dist
**/.e2e-staging
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
engine/deps
engine/model
engine/models
*.gguf
*.safetensors
.git
